{"seq":37,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"07db8722-8c23-4fb6-b354-edbf8b2423f7","runId":"run_1_1788552722671","result":"Done! I've saved the regex to `/app/regex.txt`. \n\nThe regex works as follows:\n\n- **`(?=.*\\bIPv4\\b)`**: Lookahead asserting the line contains a valid IPv4 address\n- **`.*\\b`**: Matches everything up to a word boundary before the last date\n- **`(DATE_PATTERN)`**: Captured group for the date, with three alternatives for different month/day combinations\n- **`\\b(?!.*\\bDATE\\b)$`**: Ensures the captured date is the last one in the line (via negative lookahead) and is at line end\n\nThe regex correctly:\n- Rejects IPv4s with leading zeros (e.g., 192.168.001.1)\n- Validates month/day combinations (Feb ≤ 29, Apr/Jun/Sep/Nov ≤ 30, others ≤ 31)\n- Uses word boundaries to avoid matching numbers embedded in text\n- Captures only the last date when multiple dates exist in a line","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":86042,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"07db8722-8c23-4fb6-b354-edbf8b2423f7","total_cost_usd":0.09387585000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14987,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":14249,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13157},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14987},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":280,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14044,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14044,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"